Subject: [PATCH 1/4] backlight: aat2870: Use backlight helper
Date:   Tue,  7 Jun 2022 21:09:22 +0200
Message-Id: <20220607190925.1134737-2-steve@sk2.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.30.2
